          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elosi asarae a akim kidiama alokeno a ngakipeyos, abu emalaikat a Ekapolon Akuj tolot kidiama alotooma asarae a akim, iteete Manoa ka aberu keng. Sodi tadakakinos kesi kwap tatapa ngireetin ngalup. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyebuno emalaikat a Ekapolon Akuj nia Manoa ka a beru keng nabo jik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
