        {
          "text": "Kidou aberu ngina ikoku nisapat, tolimok ekiro keng Samson. Abu idia topolou, topia Ekapolon Akuj ngesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.24",
